OL,3,APip benefit system 'not fit for
OL,4,Apurpose' and 'dehumanising' assessments
OL,5,Ashould change, review finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe system behind the Pip disability
OL,8,Fbenefit in England and Wales is "not
OL,9,Ffit for purpose" and often
OL,10,F"dehumanising" for disabled people, a
OL,11,Freview finds - what else does it say?
OL,13,FThe government says it'll immediately
OL,14,Fadopt two recommendations: quicker
OL,15,Fpayments for people with the most
OL,16,Fsevere conditions and terminal
OL,17,Fillnesses, and reducing "unnecessary"
OL,18,Freviews for some with lifelong
OL,19,Fconditions
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
