OL,3,ATwo arrested on suspicion of burglary
OL,4,Aat Prince and Princess of Wales's
OL,5,ANorfolk home
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof burglary and trespass at the Prince
OL,9,Fand Princess of Wales's country home on
OL,10,Fthe Sandringham estate, police say.
OL,12,FNorfolk Police said it received a call
OL,13,Fjust before 18:00 on Monday following a
OL,14,Freport of suspicious activity at Anmer
OL,15,FHall.
OL,17,FPolice deployed dogs, drones and a
OL,18,Fhelicopter to search the area and
OL,19,Farrested two men on the estate, who
OL,20,Fremain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
