OL,3,ANato chief vows defence against space
OL,4,Athreat after Russian nuclear satellite
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz said
OL,8,Fsuch reports were "not new, yet they
OL,9,Fremain no less shocking", and a
OL,10,Fgovernment spokesman said the reports
OL,11,Fwere being taken "very seriously".
OL,13,FKremlin spokesman Dmitry Peskov said he
OL,14,Fhad not seen the reports but dismissed
OL,15,Fstories citing "unknown sources" as
OL,16,F"hardly worth taking seriously".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
